  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2004.02 Hearing Requirement for Municipalities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2004.02 Hearing Requirement for Municipalities. If required by RSA 31:95-b, a municipal applicant shall conduct a public hearing in accordance with that section. If a hearing is held, the municipality shall provide written minutes of the hearing or town meeting in the application materials.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 2000) #8411, eff 8-19-05; ss by #9570, eff 10-17-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq2000.html"
